# ZCore duoc dong goi vao app.asar va chay tren Node nen LF la chuan.
#
# Git for Windows mac dinh core.autocrlf=true, se doi LF -> CRLF khi checkout.
# Dieu do lam doi byte cua file nguon va pha vo buoc kiem tra SHA-256 bao dam
# logic Auto Sell khong bi sua. Ep LF de moi may checkout ra cung mot noi dung.
* text=auto eol=lf

# File batch cua Windows giu CRLF theo dung quy uoc cua he dieu hanh.
*.bat text eol=crlf

# Tai nguyen nhi phan khong duoc dung vao.
*.ico binary
*.png binary
*.exe binary
